   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Solid rectangle = deterministic code (no model call)\nRounded rectangle = model call\nDiamond = decision point\nCylinder = data artifact on disk\nSolid arrow = data flow\nDashed arrow = evaluation / measurement flow\nDashed box outline = measured flat, removed from the pipeline\n\nGrey = deterministic code \u00b7 Blue = model call \u00b7 Violet = data artifact\nTeal = decision \u00b7 Amber = human review or caution \u00b7 Green = eval harness",
   "originalText": "Solid rectangle = deterministic code (no model call)\nRounded rectangle = model call\nDiamond = decision point\nCylinder = data artifact on disk\nSolid arrow = data flow\nDashed arrow = evaluation / measurement flow\nDashed box outline = measured flat, removed from the pipeline\n\nGrey = deterministic code \u00b7 Blue = model call \u00b7 Violet = data artifact\nTeal = decision \u00b7 Amber = human review or caution \u00b7 Green = eval harness",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
